# Options persistence, part 1 (run 857, agent-c; port/tools/modes-check.py): from a blank SRAM,
# title -> English -> Options -> Sound: BGM up one (8 -> 9), SE down one (8 -> 7), sound mode Mono,
# OK, back.  The game writes the options record (SRAM 0x1F8 and its mirror 0x7FC8, include/gdl/backup.h
# BackupOptions): flags 2 (Mono; the language-menu bit 8 was cleared by the English pick), levels
# 9, 7, 8.  Part 2 is options_reload.input on the saved file in a new process.
PADS 1
F 480:3 START          # title "Press START" -> language select
F 560:3 A              # English
F 620:3 DU             # main menu: Match Race -> Options (wrap)
F 700:3 A              # Options (rows Replay, Sound, Language, Erase Saved Data)
F 820:3 DD             # -> Sound
F 900:3 A              # Sound: BGM / SE / VOICE bars, Stereo / Headset / Mono
F 1000:3 DR            # BGM 8 -> 9
F 1060:3 DD            # -> SE
F 1120:3 DL            # SE 8 -> 7
F 1180:3 DD            # -> VOICE
F 1240:3 DD            # -> the sound mode
F 1300:3 DR            # Stereo -> Headset
F 1360:3 DR            # -> Mono
F 1420:3 A             # OK: the options are saved
F 1540:3 B             # back to the main menu
# END 1700
